{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"54歲女子疑遭私家車撞斃　警方拘男司機涉危駕\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/TA-TM-261103-06.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】屯門一名女子懷疑遭私家車撞倒，送院後不治，警方拘捕一名司機。</p><p>現場是青山公路洪水橋段近鍾屋村。警方接獲途人報案，指一名女子倒卧草叢附近。警方到場發現一名54歲女子昏迷不醒，由救護車送院，搶救後不治。</p><p>警方經調查後，拘捕一名男司機，涉嫌危險駕駛引致他人死亡。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T00:40:41.431467+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T23:30:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:37.731031+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T00:38:27.217943+00:00","content_hash":"fda918292b2e21cd8cab1860bbf8bcc5966d57ca5ce0291ff696edc225181fb3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}